WEBVTT

00:00:02.140 --> 00:00:04.100
I won't ask again, Kiyoshi.

00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:06.590
Come out of there, immediately.

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:09.300
You there!

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:10.820
Do <i>not</i> touch yourself
at a time like this!

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:12.020
I have an itch!

00:00:12.870 --> 00:00:14.810
What is going on here?!

00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:17.770
At the very end, my defecation sound is not playing!

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:19.850
No answer?

00:00:21.110 --> 00:00:21.990
In that case...

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:26.220
I'll just do <i>this</i>!

00:01:57.550 --> 00:01:58.790
Oh, God!

00:02:02.380 --> 00:02:03.250
Why, you...

00:02:03.710 --> 00:02:05.880
If you're in there, then answer me!

00:02:05.880 --> 00:02:06.960
I'm sorry...

00:02:07.210 --> 00:02:09.800
Your hemorrhoids are so bad they brought you to tears?

00:02:09.800 --> 00:02:12.700
Crying on the toilet, how revolting!

00:02:12.700 --> 00:02:14.490
Get back to your
posts immediately!

00:02:15.140 --> 00:02:17.400
You've been in the
restroom a little too long.

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:18.930
You've still got to do your work.

00:02:18.930 --> 00:02:20.690
I'm sorry, Shingo.

00:02:23.660 --> 00:02:24.560
Kiyoshi-dono...

00:02:27.420 --> 00:02:28.990
You...

00:02:29.570 --> 00:02:31.860
You returned just in time!

00:02:32.550 --> 00:02:33.520
I couldn't help but fear

00:02:33.520 --> 00:02:35.330
that you would be so caught
up with the sumo matches,

00:02:35.330 --> 00:02:37.120
that you would be
delayed in your return!

00:02:37.790 --> 00:02:39.700
Why do you weep?

00:02:39.700 --> 00:02:44.000
If you've returned this quickly, you must have cut your sumo time short, correct?

00:02:44.560 --> 00:02:46.810
Gakuto, it's hopeless...

00:02:46.810 --> 00:02:49.260
I'm... I'm the worst...

00:02:49.830 --> 00:02:51.590
What did you just say...?

00:02:51.590 --> 00:02:52.950
It was no good...

00:02:52.950 --> 00:02:54.350
You don't mean...

00:02:54.350 --> 00:02:57.220
you're back 10 minutes early because you failed to acquire my figurines?!

00:02:59.430 --> 00:03:01.990
The Three Kingdoms Fair only comes once every four years,

00:03:01.990 --> 00:03:04.860
and I had to soil myself and ruin
my three years of high school to—

00:03:04.860 --> 00:03:08.440
What do you take yours truly's seven years to be?!

00:03:08.440 --> 00:03:10.180
Simply saying "It was no good" does not cover it!

00:03:10.180 --> 00:03:11.670
Go back and buy them right now!

00:03:11.670 --> 00:03:14.320
Yours truly's figurines!
His Guan Yu and Red Hare figurines!

00:03:14.860 --> 00:03:17.240
Oh, no, I bought your figurines for you.

00:03:17.240 --> 00:03:18.200
Look.

00:03:20.750 --> 00:03:22.970
Kiyoshi-dono, don't do that to me!

00:03:22.970 --> 00:03:24.680
A little "prison punking," was it?

00:03:24.680 --> 00:03:27.000
Well, actually, my sumo date—

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:30.200
Ah, we have to hurry back!
They might still suspect something!

00:03:30.200 --> 00:03:32.440
I'll just tuck away my
figurines here for now,

00:03:32.440 --> 00:03:33.930
and return for them later.

00:03:34.330 --> 00:03:37.460
My word, Kiyoshi-dono, you are quite the thespian.

00:03:37.460 --> 00:03:40.070
Those tears were incredibly authentic.

00:03:40.070 --> 00:03:43.060
Yeah, well, I'm back so soon because my date—

00:03:43.060 --> 00:03:44.100
Those shoes...

00:03:46.360 --> 00:03:47.950
It was you, wasn't it?

00:03:48.600 --> 00:03:49.610
Did you enjoy yourself?

00:03:49.610 --> 00:03:51.530
At the sumo matches, that is?

00:03:51.970 --> 00:03:53.530
What are you talking about?

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:56.990
You're the one I stopped at
the school gate, aren't you?

00:03:57.330 --> 00:03:59.870
No, I've been in the restroom all this time—

00:03:59.870 --> 00:04:01.330
Oh, is that right?

00:04:01.330 --> 00:04:04.040
Then, this isn't you?

00:04:05.260 --> 00:04:08.050
"I'm watching the sumo matches with Kiyoshi-kun right now!

00:04:08.050 --> 00:04:12.420
Dad, Onee-chan, thank you for giving Kiyoshi-kun permission to leave.

00:04:12.430 --> 00:04:16.090
It doesn't have anything to do with sumo,
but I took this great picture, so I'm sending it to you.

00:04:16.090 --> 00:04:19.010
Note his nose and cheek. Heart."

00:04:21.320 --> 00:04:21.850
Oh...

00:04:22.570 --> 00:04:23.850
God!

00:04:24.440 --> 00:04:27.980
You've got some nerve playing my dear little sister.

00:04:27.980 --> 00:04:30.190
Her little sister?! Chiyo-chan?!

00:04:31.590 --> 00:04:32.750
What's going on?

00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:34.380
<i>Everything</i> is going on.

00:04:34.380 --> 00:04:36.770
Did those two do something?

00:04:36.770 --> 00:04:39.420
Vice President, examine his bag.

00:04:39.420 --> 00:04:39.780
Yes.

00:04:43.560 --> 00:04:45.410
These cuticles...

00:04:45.900 --> 00:04:48.920
Why, you... You used Dirty Four-eyes' hair as a wig!

00:04:48.920 --> 00:04:50.730
Hey, man, you don't mean...

00:04:50.730 --> 00:04:51.180
No way.

00:04:51.180 --> 00:04:54.040
That's what it looks like, all right.

00:04:54.760 --> 00:04:57.930
I don't know how you were
able to steal a girl's uniform,

00:04:58.170 --> 00:05:02.600
but there is no mistake that you disguised yourself as a girl and escaped, correct?

00:05:07.440 --> 00:05:07.850
Yes.

00:05:07.850 --> 00:05:08.600
Huh?

00:05:08.600 --> 00:05:12.480
But an escape means that we're all held liable,
and our sentences are extended another month, right?

00:05:12.480 --> 00:05:14.780
Tch. F**k! Are you serious?

00:05:16.230 --> 00:05:16.950
President!

00:05:16.950 --> 00:05:19.360
This is your little sister's uniform!

00:05:21.180 --> 00:05:22.620
You...

00:05:22.980 --> 00:05:24.510
disgust me.

00:05:26.200 --> 00:05:29.420
Today's work is hereby suspended! All of you, return to the prison!

00:05:29.640 --> 00:05:32.320
Kiyoshi, wait here
for further instructions!

00:05:32.320 --> 00:05:33.420
And say your prayers!

00:05:41.290 --> 00:05:43.950
You broke out of prison
for a date with a girl?!

00:05:43.950 --> 00:05:44.930
How selfish of you!

00:05:45.470 --> 00:05:47.630
Do you have anything to say for yourself?! Eh?!

00:05:48.280 --> 00:05:49.060
I'm sorry.

00:05:49.060 --> 00:05:50.240
Don't you "sorry" me!

00:05:50.240 --> 00:05:51.650
Shingo-kun! Stop it!

00:05:51.650 --> 00:05:52.640
Whoa, what's going on?

00:05:52.640 --> 00:05:53.240
A fight?

00:05:53.240 --> 00:05:54.110
No way, what for?

00:05:54.110 --> 00:05:54.980
I'm scared!

00:05:55.600 --> 00:05:57.900
You played us all for chumps

00:05:57.900 --> 00:06:00.110
while you went and got
it on with a girl, huh?!

00:06:01.200 --> 00:06:02.410
I'm sorry.

00:06:03.650 --> 00:06:06.060
Kiyoshi, you're despicable.

00:06:19.580 --> 00:06:22.010
You'll be staying here in
solitary confinement.

00:06:22.010 --> 00:06:26.350
Breaking out is one thing, but to make a move on the president's little sister?

00:06:26.350 --> 00:06:27.810
You won't be getting
off easily for that.

00:06:34.420 --> 00:06:35.230
I...

00:06:37.430 --> 00:06:39.560
can't stay here any longer...

00:06:43.880 --> 00:06:46.330
That wig you made from Dirty Four-eyes' hair—

00:06:46.580 --> 00:06:48.080
What about that?

00:06:48.080 --> 00:06:49.310
That...

00:06:49.310 --> 00:06:51.830
I took Gakuto's cut off hair, and made it from that.

00:06:51.830 --> 00:06:52.900
That so?

00:06:52.900 --> 00:06:56.440
So you're saying that Dirty Four-eyes
had nothing to do with the breakout?

00:06:56.440 --> 00:06:57.540
Yes.

00:06:57.540 --> 00:07:02.220
All I involved him in was in asking him to say I was in the restroom while I was gone.

00:07:02.520 --> 00:07:05.350
Then what was that crapping
sound I heard in the restroom?

00:07:05.730 --> 00:07:06.880
I don't know.

00:07:06.880 --> 00:07:09.450
I was outside the school
grounds at the time.

00:07:09.450 --> 00:07:11.890
There was probably someone else in there.

00:07:11.890 --> 00:07:14.490
You're saying that you acted alone?

00:07:14.490 --> 00:07:15.230
Yes.

00:07:15.230 --> 00:07:17.380
I have one last thing to ask.

00:07:17.380 --> 00:07:19.480
Why did you steal Chiyo's uniform?

00:07:20.230 --> 00:07:22.950
I... didn't know it was hers.

00:07:22.950 --> 00:07:24.220
Really.

00:07:24.220 --> 00:07:26.910
I took Chiyo-chan's
uniform by coincidence.

00:07:27.230 --> 00:07:29.620
Do <i>not</i> speak of her little sister with such familiarity!

00:07:42.450 --> 00:07:43.590
I'll come back later.

00:07:47.130 --> 00:07:49.760
I will now deliver judgment over this escape incident.

00:07:49.760 --> 00:07:51.250
Kiyoshi, the accused.

00:07:51.690 --> 00:07:53.890
While on duty watching belongings,

00:07:53.890 --> 00:07:55.940
you carried out an escape attempt, unaided. Is this correct?

00:07:56.750 --> 00:07:58.190
Yes.

00:07:58.550 --> 00:08:01.110
Kiyoshi-dono, you're accepting sole responsibility?

00:08:01.110 --> 00:08:04.780
As has been explained to you all,
everyone is collectively liable for a breakout.

00:08:05.240 --> 00:08:09.830
Therefore, everyone besides Kiyoshi will have their sentence extended by one month.

00:08:10.580 --> 00:08:15.230
As for Kiyoshi, your crimes are breaking out,
larceny, and illicit sexual relations.

00:08:15.840 --> 00:08:18.580
For these crimes, you
are hereby expelled.

00:08:23.220 --> 00:08:25.450
Imagine, getting expelled for it...

00:08:26.380 --> 00:08:27.800
It's shocking, isn't it?

00:08:31.910 --> 00:08:33.380
This is despotism!

00:08:33.380 --> 00:08:37.270
On whose authority can the Underground Student Council expel Kiyoshi-dono?!

00:08:37.270 --> 00:08:40.390
They do not have the compelling power to mandate this!

00:08:40.390 --> 00:08:42.150
Let us all appeal this to the school!

00:08:42.470 --> 00:08:44.020
What are you getting
so worked up for?

00:08:44.020 --> 00:08:46.310
How can I <i>not</i> get
worked up over this?!

00:08:46.850 --> 00:08:50.290
Shingo-dono, are you saying
Kiyoshi-dono's expulsion bothers you not?!

00:08:50.290 --> 00:08:51.120
Not really.

00:08:51.120 --> 00:08:52.960
What are you saying?

00:08:52.960 --> 00:08:56.500
Shingo-dono, you have known
Kiyoshi-dono since middle school.

00:08:56.500 --> 00:08:58.310
And you call yourself his friend?!

00:08:59.580 --> 00:09:03.550
If we're such great buds, then why didn't Kiyoshi tell us about the breakout?!

00:09:04.140 --> 00:09:07.180
It was because Kiyoshi thought we'd rat him out, wasn't it?!

00:09:07.750 --> 00:09:10.480
He just didn't trust us!

00:09:10.480 --> 00:09:13.350
<i>He's</i> the one who doesn't
consider us his buds!

00:09:14.320 --> 00:09:16.410
That's certainly true.

00:09:16.410 --> 00:09:17.270
Mm-hmm.

00:09:18.250 --> 00:09:20.860
That... simply cannot be.

00:09:20.860 --> 00:09:24.220
You know, you're standing up a lot for Kiyoshi here.

00:09:24.220 --> 00:09:27.110
Don't tell me you helped him with this.

00:09:30.200 --> 00:09:33.660
That... is not so.

00:09:35.320 --> 00:09:37.120
There is no way.

00:09:37.120 --> 00:09:40.980
President, I understand your desire to expel Kiyoshi,

00:09:40.980 --> 00:09:42.540
but we don't have the
authority to do so.

00:09:43.050 --> 00:09:45.980
We really can't just decide this without running it through a staff meeting—

00:09:45.980 --> 00:09:47.920
It will not be a problem, Vice President.

00:09:55.000 --> 00:09:56.060
Is this...?

00:09:56.060 --> 00:09:58.980
But... will he be willing to fill it out?

00:09:59.360 --> 00:10:00.520
We will <i>make</i> him fill it out.

00:10:00.520 --> 00:10:02.720
Go and bring Kiyoshi back here.

00:10:03.520 --> 00:10:05.600
Yes. Excuse me.

00:10:09.080 --> 00:10:12.790
I offended Chiyo-chan, and got slugged by Shingo.

00:10:12.790 --> 00:10:15.410
I really am scum.

00:10:15.410 --> 00:10:16.910
I can't even think of an excuse.

00:10:17.990 --> 00:10:20.090
I don't have the self-confidence to stay here,

00:10:20.090 --> 00:10:21.670
or to face the guys anymore.

00:10:22.500 --> 00:10:23.560
Leaving school...

00:10:24.000 --> 00:10:26.590
Maybe it'll be for the best...

00:10:33.770 --> 00:10:36.440
Chiyo, are you okay?

00:10:42.140 --> 00:10:44.230
I'm hungry.

00:10:45.700 --> 00:10:49.990
I thought about it all night,
and I think I'm partly to blame, too.

00:10:49.990 --> 00:10:51.450
How do you figure?

00:10:51.450 --> 00:10:55.400
I was so surprised that Kiyoshi had my torn uniform,

00:10:55.400 --> 00:10:57.800
that I decided he was a degenerate, right on the spot.

00:10:59.720 --> 00:11:01.250
But not asking him why,

00:11:01.250 --> 00:11:05.330
and just leaving like I did might not have been right.

00:11:05.330 --> 00:11:07.280
I'm sure there was
a good reason for it.

00:11:07.280 --> 00:11:09.510
That's what I respect about you.

00:11:10.350 --> 00:11:13.510
You were so pale when you got back yesterday, like a zombie,

00:11:13.510 --> 00:11:16.070
but after a night's sleep,
here you are eating tonkatsu.

00:11:16.070 --> 00:11:16.750
Huh?

00:11:16.750 --> 00:11:18.390
What do you mean?
Was that a compliment?

00:11:18.390 --> 00:11:19.320
Did you hear?

00:11:19.320 --> 00:11:21.600
Yesterday, one of the boys broke out.

00:11:21.600 --> 00:11:22.920
I know!

00:11:22.920 --> 00:11:25.140
I heard he dressed as a girl
and went out the front gate.

00:11:25.140 --> 00:11:26.060
Gross!

00:11:26.060 --> 00:11:29.130
And now, seems he's getting expelled for that, too.

00:11:29.130 --> 00:11:31.030
Huh? Expelled?!

00:11:38.950 --> 00:11:39.700
Get out.

00:11:41.190 --> 00:11:42.160
Excuse the interruption.

00:11:43.570 --> 00:11:45.040
I've brought Kiyoshi.

00:11:46.200 --> 00:11:48.750
Fill in your name here.

00:11:48.750 --> 00:11:50.750
Are you telling me to
voluntarily drop out?

00:11:50.750 --> 00:11:51.460
That's correct.

00:11:51.460 --> 00:11:54.680
I was certain that you were going to force me out—

00:11:54.680 --> 00:11:58.050
Considering the crimes that you committed, of course we are.

00:11:58.050 --> 00:12:01.760
Vice President, stop that, no intimidation.

00:12:01.760 --> 00:12:02.520
Yes.

00:12:02.520 --> 00:12:04.980
This is for your own good as well.

00:12:04.980 --> 00:12:06.380
My own good?

00:12:06.380 --> 00:12:07.570
Yes.

00:12:07.570 --> 00:12:11.910
Rumors that you stole a girl's uniform and dressed up as a girl will spread quickly.

00:12:12.840 --> 00:12:16.240
Once that happens, will you have any place at this school?

00:12:17.090 --> 00:12:18.570
For the next three years,

00:12:18.570 --> 00:12:21.080
you are certain to be
treated like a pervert.

00:12:22.160 --> 00:12:24.540
So, this is for your own good.

00:12:25.080 --> 00:12:28.250
I believe that rather than being
treated as a disgusting pervert here,

00:12:28.690 --> 00:12:33.670
you'd probably rather live someplace
where no one knows of your predilections.

00:12:33.990 --> 00:12:35.630
Now, sign this.

00:12:35.630 --> 00:12:37.180
You will feel better.

00:12:39.510 --> 00:12:41.950
The president is definitely right.

00:12:41.950 --> 00:12:45.850
There's no point in me
staying here now. But...

00:12:51.020 --> 00:12:55.000
I just wish I could have cleared up Chiyo-chan's misunderstanding.

00:12:56.320 --> 00:12:57.360
Onee-chan!

00:12:57.360 --> 00:12:59.740
What do you mean, Kiyoshi-kun has to leave school?!

00:12:59.740 --> 00:13:00.830
Chiyo-chan?

00:13:00.830 --> 00:13:02.240
Kiyoshi-kun!

00:13:03.540 --> 00:13:04.730
Is that...?

00:13:04.730 --> 00:13:06.440
Chiyo, what are you doing here?

00:13:06.440 --> 00:13:09.440
Why are you kicking him out,
just for leaving the school grounds?

00:13:09.440 --> 00:13:12.300
And even worse, forcing
him to leave willingly!

00:13:12.300 --> 00:13:13.860
You make me sound so mean.

00:13:13.860 --> 00:13:16.340
He chose to drop out on his own.

00:13:16.340 --> 00:13:20.510
Besides, he's also guilty of larceny and illicit sexual conduct!

00:13:21.080 --> 00:13:22.220
Expulsion is completely appropriate!

00:13:22.500 --> 00:13:24.930
If it was illicit sexual conduct, then I'm guilty, too, aren't I?

00:13:24.930 --> 00:13:26.570
You're the victim!

00:13:26.570 --> 00:13:29.530
You were enticed by this boy to go
watch the sumo matches with him!

00:13:29.530 --> 00:13:31.480
You're wrong. I invited <i>him</i>!

00:13:31.480 --> 00:13:35.360
You're covering for the degenerate
who stole and tore your uniform?!

00:13:35.360 --> 00:13:39.580
Well, there has to be a reason for that, right, Kiyoshi-kun?

00:13:40.750 --> 00:13:42.650
I'm sorry for what I did.

00:13:42.650 --> 00:13:46.400
I was so shocked, I said such a terrible thing to you,

00:13:46.400 --> 00:13:48.370
and then I ran away
without asking you why.

00:13:48.370 --> 00:13:51.150
Chiyo-chan, it really
was just a coincidence!

00:13:51.150 --> 00:13:54.420
I know it was wrong to steal a uniform,
but Chiyo-chan, I didn't know it was yours—

00:13:54.420 --> 00:13:56.550
Shut up! Don't make up excuses!

00:13:56.550 --> 00:13:58.800
Stop it, Meiko-chan! How horrible!

00:13:58.800 --> 00:14:00.260
Whoa...!

00:14:00.550 --> 00:14:03.640
Kiyoshi-kun broke out to keep his promise to me!

00:14:03.640 --> 00:14:05.520
That means I'm culpable, too, right?

00:14:05.520 --> 00:14:07.140
You're the <i>victim</i> here!

00:14:07.140 --> 00:14:09.730
And you, <i>get away</i> from Chiyo, Kiyoshi!

00:14:11.050 --> 00:14:15.710
In any case, if Kiyoshi-kun is dropping out, then so am I!

00:14:15.710 --> 00:14:16.360
Huh?!

00:14:16.360 --> 00:14:17.980
What sort of absurdity is that?

00:14:20.150 --> 00:14:21.620
Stop this nonsense!

00:14:21.620 --> 00:14:23.070
Chiyo-san, don't!

00:14:23.070 --> 00:14:24.410
Let go, Meiko-chan!

00:14:24.870 --> 00:14:28.160
Why are you being so stubborn over this degenerate, Chiyo?!

00:14:28.160 --> 00:14:30.280
Kiyoshi-kun isn't that kind of boy!

00:14:30.280 --> 00:14:31.860
You said so yourself, didn't you?

00:14:31.860 --> 00:14:33.880
Anyone who likes crows
isn't a bad person!

00:14:33.880 --> 00:14:39.130
Kiyoshi-kun is a nice guy, he helped some baby crows that fell out of their nest!

00:14:39.130 --> 00:14:41.340
This... boy...?

00:14:42.090 --> 00:14:43.200
Crows...?

00:14:45.870 --> 00:14:47.440
I don't believe it.

00:14:48.350 --> 00:14:49.560
I saw him!

00:14:49.560 --> 00:14:52.020
I'm sure you must be mistaken.

00:14:52.020 --> 00:14:56.190
Now, Kiyoshi, sign this withdrawal request at once!

00:14:57.410 --> 00:14:58.820
I...

00:14:59.980 --> 00:15:01.740
I won't sign it.

00:15:01.740 --> 00:15:03.870
What... did you just say?

00:15:03.870 --> 00:15:07.950
No matter what hardships
await me from here on out,

00:15:07.950 --> 00:15:11.080
I swear I will be rehabilitated,
that I will turn over a new leaf!

00:15:11.080 --> 00:15:12.750
Which means I'm not dropping out!

00:15:13.110 --> 00:15:15.710
You see? Kiyoshi-kun is
sorry for what he did!

00:15:18.630 --> 00:15:19.930
Enough.

00:15:19.930 --> 00:15:21.670
Take Kiyoshi back to the prison.

00:15:23.190 --> 00:15:24.010
Onee-chan...

00:15:25.310 --> 00:15:28.850
if you make Kiyoshi-kun drop out, I'll submit this, too.

00:15:34.690 --> 00:15:36.670
I cleared things up with Chiyo-chan,

00:15:37.730 --> 00:15:40.030
and had my face in Chiyo-chan's boobs.

00:15:40.590 --> 00:15:42.700
Chiyo-chan's boobs are so soft.

00:15:42.700 --> 00:15:45.970
Chiyo-chan's boobs smelled so ridiculously good...

00:15:46.890 --> 00:15:49.580
Her boobs... Her boobs...

00:15:50.700 --> 00:15:52.240
Chiyo-chan's boobs...

00:15:56.510 --> 00:15:59.650
As of right now, any reason
I had for leaving this school is...

00:16:00.140 --> 00:16:00.870
gone!

00:16:02.900 --> 00:16:07.800
Anyone who likes crows isn't a bad person, huh?

00:16:10.010 --> 00:16:11.770
Guys, I'm back.

00:16:12.230 --> 00:16:15.080
I managed to avoid getting expelled.

00:16:15.080 --> 00:16:17.220
I'm really sorry about all this!

00:16:21.780 --> 00:16:23.390
Well, good for you.

00:16:24.010 --> 00:16:25.550
Thanks, Gakuto.

00:16:25.550 --> 00:16:26.990
What's tonight's dinner?

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:29.650
Oh, um...

00:16:29.650 --> 00:16:31.740
Huh? Mine's not here.

00:16:32.290 --> 00:16:33.290
I'll go get it.

00:16:33.290 --> 00:16:35.000
There isn't any for you.

00:16:35.000 --> 00:16:35.730
Huh?

00:16:36.330 --> 00:16:39.840
Well, we thought you got expelled, so we split your share.

00:16:42.370 --> 00:16:43.170
Sorry.

00:16:43.440 --> 00:16:46.070
I see... That's okay.

00:16:46.070 --> 00:16:49.140
Go ahead and eat. Consider it part of my apology.

00:16:49.140 --> 00:16:52.170
You can have one of
yours truly's tatsutage.

00:16:52.170 --> 00:16:53.470
Really? You mean it?

00:16:54.230 --> 00:16:58.190
Oh, Gakuto, I just love tatsutage.

00:16:58.640 --> 00:16:59.810
If you don't want yours, I'll take it.

00:16:59.810 --> 00:17:03.050
Well, I was giving it to Kiyoshi-dono...

00:17:03.050 --> 00:17:04.750
It's fine, Gakuto.

00:17:06.140 --> 00:17:08.160
Yum!

00:17:14.320 --> 00:17:15.280
President,

00:17:16.800 --> 00:17:19.170
are you sure we should leave
things with Kiyoshi like this?

00:17:19.560 --> 00:17:20.540
"Like this"?

00:17:21.370 --> 00:17:24.100
I mean, with Kiyoshi not dropping out.

00:17:24.100 --> 00:17:25.010
Oh...

00:17:25.010 --> 00:17:27.340
Of course we're going to
have him drop out.

00:17:28.360 --> 00:17:31.050
And not just Kiyoshi, but <i>all </i>of the boys.

00:17:47.790 --> 00:17:48.360
Gakuto...

00:17:49.200 --> 00:17:52.330
As ever, he is interested in
nothing but the Three Kingdoms.

00:17:53.160 --> 00:17:54.240
Joe...

00:17:54.240 --> 00:17:56.190
Preoccupied with his ant farm.

00:17:57.470 --> 00:17:58.620
Andre...

00:17:59.030 --> 00:18:01.250
Has a diary hidden under his bed—

00:18:01.250 --> 00:18:01.880
Hmm?

00:18:02.530 --> 00:18:07.090
"Today, I had a dream where I licked
the vice president's dirty boots clean."

00:18:07.520 --> 00:18:09.300
This is a diary?

00:18:09.300 --> 00:18:10.050
Whatever.

00:18:11.340 --> 00:18:12.050
Shingo...

00:18:12.800 --> 00:18:13.930
Has a disordered room.

00:18:15.150 --> 00:18:18.550
Appears upset about his sentence being lengthened.

00:18:19.060 --> 00:18:24.130
In 645, Prince Naka-no-Oe and Nakatomi-no-Kamatari

00:18:24.130 --> 00:18:28.520
assassinated Soga-no-Iruka, who at the time was flourishing.

00:18:28.520 --> 00:18:29.700
The series of reforms that followed
A piece of eraser?

00:18:29.700 --> 00:18:32.230
The series of reforms that followed

00:18:32.230 --> 00:18:34.910
are known as the Taika Reforms.

00:18:34.910 --> 00:18:37.310
Following the Asuka period...

00:18:40.420 --> 00:18:43.200
Who's doing that?! Stop it!

00:18:49.850 --> 00:18:52.820
Today's prison detail is athletic storeroom maintenance

00:18:52.820 --> 00:18:55.000
and cleaning the restroom adjacent to the field.

00:18:55.000 --> 00:18:58.150
The restroom door is broken, so repair that, as well.

00:18:58.150 --> 00:18:58.970
Yes!

00:18:58.970 --> 00:19:01.560
All right, split up into two teams and get to work.

00:19:01.560 --> 00:19:02.190
Yes!

00:19:02.190 --> 00:19:06.040
Andre, Joe, let's go take care of that storeroom.

00:19:06.940 --> 00:19:10.780
The tennis club's room is near there, so it's sure to be tasty.

00:19:10.780 --> 00:19:13.260
Well then, we'll go
clean that restroom.

00:19:13.260 --> 00:19:13.910
Indeed.

00:19:13.910 --> 00:19:15.450
Hey, Gakuto!

00:19:15.450 --> 00:19:18.450
You come to the storeroom with us.

00:19:18.450 --> 00:19:21.460
No way, I can't clean
the restroom by myself.

00:19:21.460 --> 00:19:22.870
The door has to be fixed, too—

00:19:22.870 --> 00:19:24.630
You coming or not, Gakuto?

00:19:31.390 --> 00:19:34.270
They're totally shutting me out.

00:19:35.010 --> 00:19:36.970
I thought, "There's no way I'm seeing this, man!"

00:19:38.930 --> 00:19:41.990
Yeah, I brought it on
myself, but this is rough.

00:19:41.990 --> 00:19:43.390
Not too long ago,

00:19:43.390 --> 00:19:46.230
I couldn't have put
up with this situation.

00:19:46.230 --> 00:19:48.940
But now, I'll be fine!

00:19:49.560 --> 00:19:53.230
Boobs! Chiyo-chan's
boobs were incredible!

00:19:53.230 --> 00:19:54.740
Damn, were they soft!

00:19:55.470 --> 00:19:59.030
Now that I know how soft and
gentle Chiyo-chan's boobs are,

00:19:59.030 --> 00:20:00.710
I think I can endure
anything that happens.

00:20:00.710 --> 00:20:02.210
No, I will endure it!

00:20:04.290 --> 00:20:06.170
Whoops. Someone's in there.

00:20:07.310 --> 00:20:10.550
The prisoners' investigation is moving along smoothly.

00:20:11.000 --> 00:20:12.220
Good work.

00:20:12.920 --> 00:20:14.720
Please continue to work at it.

00:20:15.140 --> 00:20:17.420
Find out what their weaknesses are.

00:20:17.420 --> 00:20:18.970
For the sake of the
"Dog Transferal Operation,"

00:20:19.930 --> 00:20:22.480
codenamed "Operation DTO."

00:20:22.720 --> 00:20:23.360
Yes.

00:20:23.980 --> 00:20:25.870
Operation DTO?

00:20:25.870 --> 00:20:29.740
The "O" in "DTO" and
"Operation" are the same.

00:20:29.740 --> 00:20:31.780
Should I point that out, or not?

00:20:31.780 --> 00:20:35.960
Excuse me, "Operation" is redundant there, isn't it?

00:20:35.960 --> 00:20:37.490
How careless of me.

00:20:37.780 --> 00:20:40.950
I'll rephrase. For the
sake of codename "DTO."

00:20:40.950 --> 00:20:41.980
Yes!

00:20:41.980 --> 00:20:43.450
That's the president for you!

00:20:43.450 --> 00:20:48.170
She recognizes her own mistake immediately, and is not afraid to correct herself!

00:20:48.170 --> 00:20:51.770
I am in awe of how high a caliber of person she is!

00:20:51.770 --> 00:20:53.010
I have to say,

00:20:53.480 --> 00:20:55.010
she's late, isn't she?

00:20:55.010 --> 00:20:57.530
It's about time she got here.

00:20:57.530 --> 00:20:58.930
Yes, I agree.

00:21:05.710 --> 00:21:07.990
What are you doing, sitting there?

00:21:07.990 --> 00:21:10.880
Oh, I'm not doing anything shady.

00:21:10.880 --> 00:21:13.710
I'm here to clean the restroom, but it was occupied,

00:21:13.710 --> 00:21:15.600
so I'm waiting out here
for them to finish.

00:21:15.600 --> 00:21:17.700
Ha, that job suits you.

00:21:18.110 --> 00:21:20.070
Hana-san?

00:21:20.070 --> 00:21:22.540
Wah! Hana-san is back?!

00:21:22.830 --> 00:21:24.540
I heard you broke out.

00:21:24.540 --> 00:21:27.540
Um, I need to clean the restroom, so...

00:21:29.040 --> 00:21:31.310
To run into her here, of all places...

00:21:31.310 --> 00:21:32.840
Why are you ignoring me?

00:21:32.840 --> 00:21:33.500
Wah!

00:21:33.500 --> 00:21:35.040
"Wah!"? How rude!

00:21:35.040 --> 00:21:37.140
Like I'm dirty or something.

00:21:37.140 --> 00:21:39.020
It's not that! You startled me.

00:21:39.020 --> 00:21:41.180
Of course you're not dirty!

00:21:41.180 --> 00:21:43.510
Really? I'm not dirty?

00:21:43.510 --> 00:21:45.560
You're getting a little close, aren't you?

00:21:45.560 --> 00:21:46.770
What's your problem?

00:21:46.770 --> 00:21:49.230
Do you think I'm dirty after all?

00:21:49.230 --> 00:21:50.720
It's not that!

00:21:50.720 --> 00:21:52.520
Then prove it to me!

00:21:54.080 --> 00:21:55.070
Prove it?

00:21:57.150 --> 00:21:58.400
You...

00:21:58.400 --> 00:22:01.280
haven't forgotten what
you did to me, right?

00:22:03.390 --> 00:22:04.210
Right.

00:22:05.190 --> 00:22:08.960
I'm not some monster, so I won't do anything to you worse than what you did to me.

00:22:11.060 --> 00:22:14.340
Um... that is... you don't mean...

00:22:14.690 --> 00:22:17.340
I'm not dirty, <i>right</i>?

00:22:17.340 --> 00:22:18.270
Of course not.

00:22:18.270 --> 00:22:21.140
Hana-san, you aren't dirty...

00:22:23.140 --> 00:22:25.950
Good. Then there won't be a problem.

00:22:25.950 --> 00:22:27.470
See you.

00:22:28.430 --> 00:22:32.440
I'm in a hurry today, so you can prove it to me next time, <i>thoroughly</i>.

00:22:32.840 --> 00:22:35.980
It's not like I did it on purpose, you know.

00:22:36.650 --> 00:22:38.440
This sucks.

00:22:39.660 --> 00:22:41.360
Welcome back, Hana.

00:24:36.070 --> 00:24:38.440
Next time on Prison School:

00:24:38.830 --> 00:24:41.000
"Vengeance is Hana's."
